            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Hibiscus 0.8.2 makes large notes, AI streaming, imports, and bulk note actions more responsive; adds Google and OpenRouter model discovery with more reliable settings sync; and hardens note safety with verified SQLite backups, restores, external-attachment integrity, and safer store relocation. It also fixes detached-note title persistence and several macOS path and upgrade edge cases.
]]></description>
